  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The blending of akasha and psionics you have mastered gives you unusual focus and recovery.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13 or veilweaver level 1, a power point reserve.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can invest a point of essence into this feat as a move action to regain your psionic focus. Essence invested in this way cannot be reassigned for 3 rounds. In addition, while essence is invested in this feat you gain the ability to activate two abilities which require you to expend your psionic focus as part of the same action (for example, a psion using this ability could gain the benefits of both Quicken Power and Talented as part of the same expenditure).</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc24\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
